OL,3,GNEWSA'Cancelling event was a hard
OL,4,Adecision but it was right'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a sold-out outdoor
OL,7,FHalloween attraction has said having to
OL,8,Fcancel two nights due to bad weather
OL,9,Fwas "hardest decision".
OL,11,FBarbara Ikim runs Halloweenville, based
OL,12,Fat Partridge Lakes in Warrington, which
OL,13,Fhas been running since 2 October, but
OL,14,Famid deteriorating weather decided to
OL,15,Fcall off Friday and Saturday night's
OL,16,Fevents.
OL,18,FStorm Austen, which brought heavy rain
OL,19,Fand strong winds on Friday had led to a
OL,20,Fnumber of trees at the venue falling,
OL,21,Fwith Storm Boelo expected to cause
OL,22,Ffurther upset.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
