OL,3,GNEWSA'Cancelling event was a hard
OL,4,Adecision but it was right'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Even though when I made the
OL,7,Fannouncement today it looked calm, I
OL,8,Fjust couldn't take that risk," she
OL,9,Fsaid.
